es\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004703\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000005314\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007765\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012800\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"c566d7dc-50bb-4d55-984b-c4c65751933e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006677\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008241\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Universal Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006679\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"28 Years Later: The Bone Temple\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later: The Bone Temple. In a continuation of the epic story, Dr. Kelson (Ralph Fiennes) finds himself in a shocking new relationship - with consequences that could change the world as they know it - and Spike's (Alfie Williams) encounter with Jimmy Crystal (Jack O'Connell) becomes a nightmare he can't escape. In the world of The Bone Temple, the infected are no longer the greatest threat to survival - the inhumanity of the survivors can be stranger and more terrifying. \\r\\n\\r\\nCUSTOMER NOTICE: This screening is restricted to viewers aged 18 and over. Valid identification must be presented at admission.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Expanding upon the world created by Danny Boyle and Alex Garland in 28 Years Later - but turning that world on its head - Nia DaCosta directs 28 Years Later.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-16\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":110,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rl_DJZCyEH4\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000313\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001245\",\"roles\":[\"Director\